{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt","id":1310141,"title":"The following characters enter Exalted and Exalt","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-05T17:08:19-07:00","id":1310141,"title":"The following characters enter Exalted and Exalt","content":"<span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The following character enter the setting/world of Exalted and Exalt, what type of Exalted do each of the characters become, as far as which best suits them? Which caste does that exalted become? Add your own characters if you feel like it.<br /> Lina Inverse (Slayers)<br /> The Doctor (Doctor Who)<br /> Goku (Dragon Ball Z)<br /> Spider-Man/Peter Parker (Marvel)<br /> Ashley James &quot;Ash&quot; Williams (The Evil Dead)<br /> Dean Winchester (Supernatural)<br /> Guts (Berserk)<br /> Nami (One Piece)<br /> Usopp (One Piece)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Nicholas D Wolfwood (Trigun)<br /> The Punisher/Frank Castle (The Punisher)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">John Constantine (Hellblazer)<br /> V (v for vendetta)<br /> Cloud Strife (Final Fantasy VII)<br /> Zoro (One Piece)<br /> Link (The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess) </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T17:28:53-07:00","id":1310148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt#post1310141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The following character enter the setting/world of Exalted and Exalt, what type of Exalted do each of the characters become, as far as which best suits them? Which caste does that exalted become? Add your own characters if you feel like it.<br /> Lina Inverse (Slayers)<br /> The Doctor (Doctor Who)<br /> Goku (Dragon Ball Z)<br /> Spider-Man/Peter Parker (Marvel)<br /> Ashley James &quot;Ash&quot; Williams (The Evil Dead)<br /> Dean Winchester (Supernatural)<br /> Guts (Berserk)<br /> Nami (One Piece)<br /> Usopp (One Piece)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Nicholas D Wolfwood (Trigun)<br /> The Punisher/Frank Castle (The Punisher)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">John Constantine (Hellblazer)<br /> V (v for vendetta)<br /> Cloud Strife (Final Fantasy VII)<br /> Zoro (One Piece)<br /> Link (The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess) </span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Goku seems like a bit too OP for Exalted's intended power level, or at least too unrelated to how Exalted does things. Maybe a Brawl Supernal Solar. Or an Exigent of Physical Transcendence or something.<br /> <br /> Spider-Man would probably be an Exigent of the Spider Avatar or something. <br /> <br /> Guts seems like a particularly edgy Dawn/Full Moon with Soulsteel armor<br /> <br /> Nami would likely be an Air Aspect with a useful Wrackstaff<br /> <br /> Usopp could be a Wood Aspect with a Sling of Distant Surprise<br /> <br /> Cloud's probably a Melee Supernal Dawn<br /> <br /> Zoro would be a MA Supernal Dawn with Single Point, Steel Devil-But-Actually-Good, and Thousand Blades Style<br /> <br /> Link's probably a Dawn with loads of Artifacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T20:16:10-07:00","id":1310185,"title":"","content":"Zoro wouldn't have Steel Devil, rather Steel Oni, the perfected three sword style","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T21:15:18-07:00","id":1310201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt#post1310141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lina Inverse (Slayers)<br /> The Doctor (Doctor Who)<br /> Goku (Dragon Ball Z)<br /> Spider-Man/Peter Parker (Marvel)<br /> Ashley James &quot;Ash&quot; Williams (The Evil Dead)<br /> Dean Winchester (Supernatural)<br /> Guts (Berserk)<br /> Nami (One Piece)<br /> Usopp (One Piece)[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]<br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Nicholas D Wolfwood (Trigun)<br /> The Punisher/Frank Castle (The Punisher)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">John Constantine (Hellblazer)<br /> V (v for vendetta)<br /> Cloud Strife (Final Fantasy VII)<br /> Zoro (One Piece)<br /> Link (The Legend of Zelda: Twilight Princess) </span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I'll do my best with the ones I know<br /> <br /> The Doctor - Twilight, basically no contest<br /> Goku - Dawn, also no contest.<br /> Spiderman - Maybe a Lunar? He's got physical attributes in spades, but isn't really that skilled physical ability wise.<br /> Ash Williams - Liminal exalt, again, I think no contest. He fights evil undead and loses body parts that grow into their own evil twins and stuff<br /> Dean Winchester - Possibly an Eclipse actually. He fights undead and occult things, frequently uses disguises, and has an odd habit of making allies from disparate people<br /> Guts - Dawn, or maybe Dusk<br /> Nicholas Wolfwood - Zenith<br /> Punisher - Maybe a Day caste abyssal?<br /> V - Almost certainly a Zenith. With one speech basically he takes down an empire.<br /> Link - From BotW? Probably a Zenith. Otherwise I think a Dawn just because he's a legendary storied warrior<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T21:44:15-07:00","id":1310207,"title":"","content":"Lina Inverse is a bit of a blasto wizard, but she's also a serious study of the sorcerous arts in general and is on the short list of most powerful sorcerors in the series through a combination of raw power and knowledge. She is *tremendously* Twilight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","user":"Mockery","date":". 05-06-2019, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T04:10:36-07:00","id":1310256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt?p=1310201#post1310201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Doctor - Twilight, basically no contest</div> </div> </div> </div>Eclipse! He travels through space and time and talks to people a lot in the hopes of achieving peaceful conflict resolution. Also, Twilights don't get Socialize supernal and that's where the regeneration charm lives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T04:13:46-07:00","id":1310259,"title":"","content":"The Doctor probably no sells some golden charlatan's attempts to turn him into a loyal 'Chosen' (and being a Twilight doesn't really offer him anything much more anyway)... At least that's how I'd imagine it shaking out in a Dr Who story.<br /> <br /> The normal human characters probably work out as Dr Lovemonkey says (though I really see Ash as more of Zenith - Army of Darkness Ash is the best Ash), while the powered characters I'm not sure about whether Exaltation would actually be a step up for them, or compatible with what they do (peak Cloud Strife don't need no damn Solar Dawn Exaltation to be as good or better at what he does); Dr Lovemonkey's probably right again if you assume you're shifting in pre-&quot;origin story / getting my powers&quot; versions of these characters rather than literally &quot;A portal opens to another world&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T05:23:22-07:00","id":1310270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt?p=1310185#post1310185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zoro wouldn't have Steel Devil, rather Steel Oni, the perfected three sword style</div> </div> </div> </div>I was referring to Nitoryu/Two Sword Style. Single Point being Ittoryu/One Sword Style and Thousand Blades Style being Santoryu/Three Sword Style + Asura. Thousand Blades is probably not the best fit though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T10:26:14-07:00","id":1310315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Add your own characters if you feel like it. </div> </div> </div>I'd like to talk about 2 overwhelming characters :<br /> - Superman : Supernal Brawl Dawn, Essence 6-7) with all the Athletic (obviously), Perception(hey x-ray vision), Larceny (I mean... Just some glasses and nobody recognise him). Maybe burning gase or Death Ray for laser eyes?<br /> - &quot;Sans Nom&quot; le meta-baton, from Jodorowski. Some might say he is even stronger than Superman cause he is a psychic on top of an overoverkill Fighter. Essence 6-7, 5 dots in all close range martial arts and fighting abilities, quite good athletic, and occult sorcerer for the psychics abilities. Loaded with Charms in all of those.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T11:41:23-07:00","id":1310327,"title":"","content":"I actually think Zenith (Athletics supernal, and lots of Resistance charms) fits Superman more. His deal isn't that he's amazing at combat; it's that he's a champion, a true hero of virtue. Who's also really strong and tough. (He's not actually even amazing at hand-to-hand combat; he's just really, really, really strong.)<br /> <br /> <br /> Still. Is this thread about what characters best fit, or what they'd exalt as if they were sent to Creation? Because those are not at all the same.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T12:14:32-07:00","id":1310341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt?p=1310256#post1310256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eclipse! He travels through space and time and talks to people a lot in the hopes of achieving peaceful conflict resolution. Also, Twilights don't get Socialize supernal and that's where the regeneration charm lives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahhh fuck you\u2019re totally right that he\u2019s an eclipse. He travels space and time, beyond the universe from its birth to its death, there\u2019s no way he\u2019s not an eclipse.<br /> <br /> And yes I definitely was assuming more \u201cwhat if they weren\u2019t already badass\u201d. Goku has WELL more power than it takes to blow up an entire planet so...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T12:16:03-07:00","id":1310342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1310141-the-following-characters-enter-exalted-and-exalt?p=1310327#post1310327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still. Is this thread about what characters best fit, or what they'd exalt as if they were sent to Creation? Because those are not at all the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, for one that takes Liminals, Alchemicals, Dragonblooded and debatably Abyssals and Sidereals our of the mix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T23:12:27-07:00","id":1310484,"title":"","content":"Indeed.<br /> I think Link, for example, is best represented as a Wood Aspect, but he wouldn't exalt as that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}